# Build-time configuration for the public site.
#
# THIS FILE IS NOT A SECRET AND IS MEANT TO BE COMMITTED.
# A Turnstile site key is public by design: it is compiled into the JavaScript
# every visitor downloads, and it is readable by anyone who opens the page. It
# identifies the widget, it does not authorise anything. The half that must
# stay private is the SECRET key, which lives in the Worker as a Cloudflare
# secret (`wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET`) and never appears in this
# repository.
#
# Vite only exposes variables beginning with VITE_ to the browser bundle, which
# is the guard against a private value being pulled in here by accident.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAEo7eL3gjaL5OV0a
